text = "Player 1:  A = dive button,  S = kick button
Player 2:  K = dive button,  L = kick button

On the ground: dive button jumps straight up,
kick button hops backward.
In the air: kick button dives at an angle.
Land a dive on your opponent to score.
Miss and you are stuck for a moment!"

